        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at regional storage
Shares of production in Europe (14%) and imports from China (24%) and Asia and Pacific (62%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 6bff6384-6088-3121-85cb-22b315e67fa3
Domestic production and imports of single-crystalline silicon cells used in photovoltaic module production in Europe. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6bff6384-6088-3121-85cb-22b315e67fa3.xml</text>
